{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T15:21:19.875Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d7f970542d8df5a0a6bdb3b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1728"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1728: complete-list recovery drops an explicit includeBody request, so a repaired whole-list read returns every item without bodies"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GH-1728 (filed 2026-11-14, reproduced on the published 2026.11.14 tarball). A caller requests a complete list with bodies (createCompleteListOptions({ includeBody: true }) plus a page limit); certifyCompleteListResult correctly refuses the incomplete page with PmCompleteListValidationError, but the recovery it emits omits the body request. The CLI retry (pm list --all --output-include full --strict-read --no-truncate --output-budget unbounded --output-limit unbounded --json) returns 4/4 items and 0/4 bodies, and the SDK recipe client.listAllComplete() likewise drops it; listAllComplete({ includeBody: true }) and the CLI retry with --include-body return all bodies. The recovery builder lives in src/sdk/query/complete-list.ts. The emitted retry also uses the redundant legacy --no-truncate alias, which adds a migration hint. Expected: a declared projection requirement such as includeBody survives the recovery, or the certifier says explicitly that it cannot know and offers an opt-in recipe; page-incomplete refusal and the corpus safety invariants stay unchanged. Duplicate check: searched complete list recovery include body certify; pm-y4aaol (closed) shipped the primitive and pm-gh1078 (closed) fixed a stale recovery command name."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["complete-list","gh:1728","read-output","recovery","sdk"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-14T15:21:19.875Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T15:21:19.875Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":120},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The CLI and SDK recovery for a refused complete list preserve an explicit includeBody request and use canonical flags; Specs cover a caller requesting bodies, one not requesting them, and empty bodies, executing the emitted recovery against the same fixture and comparing bodies, typed edges, learnings and counts; Page-incomplete refusal and the corpus safety invariants are unchanged"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-usfg"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reporter","value":"unbraind"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The recovery of a refused complete list returns the bodies the caller asked for"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The emitted CLI and SDK recovery return every item without bodies"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-gh1078","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-14T15:21:19.875Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-y4aaol","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-14T15:21:19.875Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be